subset of Protocol Buffer definitions vendored from the following projects:

  * Bazel Remote Execution API
    https://github.com/bazelbuild/remote-apis
    Copyright The Bazel Authors.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  * Google APIs (google/bytestream, google/rpc)
    https://github.com/googleapis/googleapis
    Copyright Google LLC.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

You may obtain a copy of the Apache License, Version 2.0 at
    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The vendored .proto files have been trimmed to the subset required by a
cache-only client. Field numbers and message names are unchanged, preserving
wire compatibility with the upstream definitions.

